==Infravision==
Slightly improved night vision, but not as good as the [[Dark Elf|Dark Elf]]'s Ultravision. Has a slightly reddish tint.

==Life Tracking==
Increased sensory range for living NPCs on your map.

==Ultravision==
:''See also: [[Ultravision]] (Spell)''
Extremely improved night vision, better than Infravision.  Ultravision has a slightly purple tint to it.


